865	 * L4D2 — NOT pure config-write (confirmed via AlliedModders, the authoritative
866	 * community source for Source-engine dedicated-server administration): the
867	 * VPK must physically exist under `addons/` before `addonlist.txt` referencing
868	 * it does anything. We fetch it with `steamcmd workshop_download_item` run
869	 * INSIDE the customer's own container — Valve's own tool, pulling straight
870	 * from Steam's CDN — never a Nxeon-hosted copy. left4devops/l4d2 exposes
871	 * `/addons` as the only persisted, bind-mounted directory
872	 * (`/opt/l4d2/addons` on the host), which is where both the fetched .vpk
873	 * files and addonlist.txt live.
874	 *
875	 * CONFIDENCE NOTE: this image documents no Workshop-specific env var at all
876	 * (checked directly against its Docker Hub page), so the exact expected
877	 * location/format of `addonlist.txt` for THIS SPECIFIC image is inferred
878	 * from the general L4D2 dedicated-server convention, not confirmed against
879	 * this image's own source — flagged here and in the delivery report rather
880	 * than presented as verified.
881	 */
882	const L4D2_APPID = WORKSHOP_APPID.l4d2;
