// One-click install/remove — the remote scripts worker/game-mods.ts runs, and
// the parsers that turn their markers into what the customer is told. Kept
// here (pure: no SSH, no DB) so test/terraria-plugins.test.ts can run the
// scripts through `sh -n`/`dash -n` and the parsers through every outcome.
// See worker/game-mods.ts's Terraria section for why an install is
// restart-and-verify rather than just "put the file in the folder".
// ===========================================================================

